-- WoW Forever quests that are on the Wowhead WoW Forever quest list but were missing from our data entirely. 251 of them are
-- added here from the AnoCore v10 world database (WoW Forever 70532): quest, objectives, texts, map areas, reward display,
-- conditions, level (quest_classic_level / quest_template_classic_level), givers and turn-ins, plus what they need and ours
-- lacked: missing NPCs (template, difficulty, model, addon, equipment, trainer, SmartAI, level), spawns of givers and kill
-- targets, hostile faction for kill targets ours had at the placeholder 35, and the objects and loot of item objectives.
-- Among them: the Camping 101 quests of Durotar, Mulgore and Teldrassil, The Great Outdoors (Teldrassil), Cooking for
-- three hubs, the Forever class quests (Call of Earth/Air, Taming the Beast, Crown of the Earth, Divine Grace, ...) and
-- many Forever zone quests.
-- Every added quest passed the usability audit (giver/turn-in reachable for its races, targets spawned and attackable,
-- items obtainable). Quests that can't be finished with this data are not added (marked NOT ADDED; the NPCs and objects
-- they brought stay): summoned or credit targets with no spawn or script (The Binding x3, Ott's Masterwork, Unwelcome
-- Guests, The Offering of Blood, Gatehouse Goods, Crown of the Earth 98067), items with no source, objects for spell foci
-- (Heed My Call, Banner of the Fallen, Snowbound, Explosive Consultation), a hostile turn-in (97287), prerequisites that don't
-- exist (95883, 98824) and their follow-ups.
-- New spawns use guid = entry * 100 + n, or the block 41000000+ where that range is taken.

