(92481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me have a look at you. Yes, I believe you will make a fine young $C. The power of the arcane has waned amongst our people, but there are those who would seek to rediscover much of what we''ve lost in the millennia we''ve spent here amongst the clouds. I am sure that you will lead the charge in this never ending search for arcane knowledge, and ultimately make us proud.$B$BSpeak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.',0);
