(94493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Al''aketh Cultists ambushed us with little to no warning. Many inside my den lay wounded or dying. I had attempted to send a message to Valanaar but it appears my efforts were in vain.$B$BPlease, if you have come here I beg for your help. I don''t know how much longer my fellows will be able to survive this onslaught.',0);
