(96204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you again, $n. I''ve been aquatinting myself with Trevan here, who I''ve learned sent you along on my trail.$B$BI''ve heard... less than charitable things about paladins thus far in my travels. As a sky-touched shen''dorei elf traveling through horde territory, I can certainly understand how easily intolerance and prejudice can take root. $B$BYou and your kind have a friend among the Windshapers.',0);
