(97899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There ya have it, directions for your very own Mana Well. Most folks don''t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you''ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to try it out.$B$BNo camp is complete without a campfire. You''ll need one of those as the basis of your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. Check in with someone who can train you in cooking if you haven''t already learned the basics.',0);
