(98393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And so it continues, Father Cenarius.$B$B<Dendrite makes a quick, invisible gesture in the air above him. A slight aura of power falls over him.>$B$BGreetings again, Hans. It is time for you to learn the next perspective of nature: the cat. I will put you on the path to understanding this aspect of druidic life, but much like the bear, it is you that must embrace this learning and propagate it.',0);
